Description

Winter 2027 Internship/Hybrid

Build the future with us

Are you passionate about innovation, emerging technologies, and experimentation? Do you want to contribute to the purpose of a company that strives to ensure its clients feel confident and secure about their future? As an Intern – Developer, you will play a key role in validating concepts, creating prototypes, and experimenting with new approaches that will help guide tomorrow’s business and technological decisions.

This position is a great opportunity to showcase your skills and fully realize your potential within a caring and trustworthy company. Here, people and their development are at the heart of our priorities, fostering an environment that encourages collaboration and innovation.

What You Will Accomplish With Us

As an Intern – Developer, you will be at the core of our mission. Here are the main responsibilities:



- Participate in the technical analysis of requirements;
- Develop prototypes, mock-ups and proofs of concept in order to validate business or technological hypotheses;
- Carry out experiments and document the learnings, findings and recommendations resulting from them;
- Contribute to the evaluation of new platforms, artificial intelligence tools and innovative solutions;
- Collaborate with business experts, technology specialists and external partners as part of the initiatives being explored;
- Participate in technology watch and applied research activities;
- Take part in co-creation workshops, ideation sessions and project progress meetings;
- Produce and maintain clear documentation regarding prototypes, learnings achieved and limitations observed;
- Comply with security standards, data protection requirements and best practices in responsible innovation.

What Could Accelerate Your Success In This Role

We are looking for someone who:



- Is currently pursuing university studies in computer science, software engineering, artificial intelligence, analytics or a related field;
- Must complete a university-credited internship during the Winter 2027 semester;
- Stands out for their curiosity toward artificial intelligence, automation, data science or other emerging technologies;
- Demonstrates strong collaboration skills;
- Shows a constant focus on quality;
- Is recognized for their analytical mindset;
- Demonstrates a strong interest in innovation, emerging technologies and experimentation;
- Is familiar with Git, DevOps and software development principles.

Why you will love working with us



- A work environment where learning and development merge with a collective pursuit of excellence.
- Artificial intelligence is in everyone's hands, enabling you to increase your personal efficiency and supporting the organization's growth.
- A healthy, safe, fair, and inclusive environment where potential can be freely expressed and developed.
- The possibility to work in a hybrid environment supported by flexibility and access to inspiring, innovative workspaces.
- Student benefits: Access to internal training, mentoring, involvement in real projects, flexible schedules adapted to studies, and a rewarding experience for your professional journey.

Apply now and get ahead of your career, where your talent really belongs! 

Still unsure about applying?

At iA, we believe in potential and value diverse experiences. If this role inspires you, go ahead and apply – your place might be with us, and we want to get to know you!
